[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery leads\nand insulate them.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Wait at least 10 minutes before\ncontinuing.</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the Air Bag\nsystem, follow the Safety Instructions for working on the system\n(See 5580C - Air Bag System - Precautions).</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely observe the Safety Regulations\nestablished for this operation .</p></aside><p>1. Working from underneath, disconnect the electrical connection\n91a) from the steering angle sensor (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Steering sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890674\">K58</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2061671.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the sensor (1b) from the\nsteering column switch unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2061672.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the steering angle\nsensor and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p>Connect the sensor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Steering sensor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890674\">K58</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2891970\">5580C12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892174\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891673\">4110A11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891972\">5580C18</a></p><p>Connect the battery leads.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2889704\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div>"]]